_tag\" ><strong>SPECIALIZE EVERY FLOOR TO FIT YOUR STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tower is  the heart of the entire strategy. Between waves of enemies, you can upgrade individual floors and combine them to create unique combinations and synergies. You have eight different floor types at your disposal, which you can further upgrade and customize. Every decision is crucial to the course of the game. In addition to the basic level, the game offers an endless mode and selectable challenges that modify the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Build your tower floor by floor and face the mechanical bugs attacking your stronghold! Add, upgrade and synergize floors of your tower to adapt to the expanding enemy paths, spanning many regions of this tower defense game.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784200/7753c573e56fb87a3ae71b611a0c470617ae5529/header.jpg?t=1786982329", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784200/09edbbb0bd256be9276596a37346ba8ccad85786/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786982329", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784200/09edbbb0bd256be9276596a37346ba8ccad85786/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786982329", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-9600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Marcin Rodzon"], "publishers": ["Marcin Rodzon"], "demos": [{"appid": 4465060, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD